; The map is the 34th–36th x Spruce–Walnut block (3792x4336 px at 1 m/tile),
; cropped to the four street edges — a PORTRAIT map in a 1920x1080 landscape
; window. zoom 0.249 contain-fits: the FULL block is visible (the height fills the
; window: 4336 * 0.249 ~= 1080 px), at the cost of grey margins on the left/right
; (a portrait map can't fill a landscape window without cropping). Centred on the
; block centre so it's symmetric.
[node name="Camera2D" type="Camera2D" parent="."]
position = Vector2(1896, 2168)
zoom = Vector2(0.249, 0.249)
